Package: labproteomics
Title: Lab Proteomics Workbench (working name): a local Shiny application for label-free quantitative proteomics
Version: 0.0.1
Authors@R: person("Daqian", "Lu", email = "res.ludaqian@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: A locally run Shiny application that packages a peptide-level
    label-free proteomics workflow (MS-DAP import, filtering, normalisation,
    protein roll-up, DEqMS differential analysis, gene-set analysis, and an
    optional two-contrast rescue classification) with a reproducible run record for
    every analysis. The statistical engine is a set of plain R functions that
    can be used without the interface.
